WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Software agents already have a life cycle. A desk lamp has no word for it.

00:12.000 --> 00:29.000
Nine named events. Four named verbs. The lamp already knows how to move.

00:29.000 --> 00:46.000
The language is light and pose. Blue while thinking. Amber to ask. Red when stuck. Green when tests pass.

00:46.000 --> 00:57.000
Tests are running. Blue, then green. You never opened a dashboard.

00:57.000 --> 01:05.000
The agent wants to push. Amber. One question.

01:05.000 --> 01:14.000
You are stuck. Red. Consent first. It never types a password.

01:14.000 --> 01:22.000
Look tips the head toward you. Follow needs a person in view.

01:22.000 --> 01:33.600
Any coding agent can plug in. Tomorrow the same commands run on a real lamp.
